; Standing stones rather than crags - cover, but arranged, because something that thinks has lived
; here for eight hundred years. The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild arranged them into a CRESCENT open to the west rather than
; a ring: a perfect circle is a diagram, and it was also the same plan the other two roosts had.
